perconductors", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10843653", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/10843653", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/10843653?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5061/dryad.1g1jwsv49", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5061/dryad.1g1jwsv49", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5061/dryad.1g1jwsv49", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10843653/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10843652", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/10843652", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:10843653/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:10843653/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10843653/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10843653/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10843653/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/10843653/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10843653/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10843653/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10843653/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10843653/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10843653/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10843653/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10843653/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10843653/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10843653/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10843653/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10843653/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10843653/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10843653/requests"}, "updated": "2024-03-20T11:55:32.753637+00:00", "recid": "10843653", "revision": 5, "files": [{"id": "b0290370-18f4-4bef-b1f3-ae0d4eed1db9", "key": "raw_data.zip", "size": 112887325, "checksum": "md5:25557eaca33babeff87227cd745d4f7d", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10843653/files/raw_data.zip/content"}}, {"id": "a577885a-4d7e-47d1-99aa-e0b36d72f496", "key": "README.md", "size": 1144, "checksum": "md5:31f88d4bc13dafac369afea35f05c200", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10843653/files/README.md/content"}}], "swh": null, "owners": [{"id": "90070"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 92, "unique_downloads": 62, "views": 90, "unique_views": 89, "version_downloads": 92, "version_unique_downloads": 62, "version_unique_views": 89, "version_views": 90}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}, {"created": "2024-01-01T21:19:49.711465+00:00", "modified": "2024-01-01T21:19:49.959600+00:00", "id": 10443995, "conceptrecid": "10443994", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.10443995", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.10443994", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10443995", "metadata": {"title": "Scanning Tunneling Microscope Images of Atomic Scale Defects in Tungsten Diselenide", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.10443995", "publication_date": "2023-12-30", "description": "<div>\n<div>This dataset contains scanning tunneling microscope (STM) data of single crystal tungsten diselenide (WSe2) provided by the Hone-Barmak Group acquired in constant current mode from two STM systems: a Low Temperature STM (LT-STM) and a room temperature STM (RT-STM). The images are of various sizes and resolutions. 136 of the STM images have associated labels of atomic-scale defects in the form of bouding boxes and image label masks. 38 annotated images were selected to construct an augmented training dataset of images and label masks saved as numpy files for convientent model training. Original, raw STM data of WSe2 is also inculded.</div>\n<br>\n<div>Code on GitHub: &lt;https://github.com/darianSmalley/ML-STM&gt;</div>\n</div>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Smalley, Darian", "affiliation": "University of Central Florida", "orcid": "0000-0002-8980-0180"}], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.48550/arXiv.2312.05160", "relation": "isPublishedIn", "resource_type": "publication-preprint", "scheme": "doi"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "communities": [{"id": "ml4matsci"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "10443994"}}]}, "notes": "<div>\"STM_Data\"</div>\n<div>These 438 raw .SXM files were aquired by the Ishigami Group LT-STM in the Department of Physics at the University of Central Florida. Imageing was performed at -1.4 V bias voltage and 60 pA tunneling current setpoint in ultra high vacume (UHV) (8e-12 torr) at liquid nitrogen temperature (77 K) by a ScientaOmicron LT-STM with Specs Zurich GmbH's 'Nanonis' SPM controls. The .SXM files are sorted into sub-folders by date of aquisition.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\"STM_images\"</div>\n<div>236 pre-processed STM images saved as .JPG. The 147 images with prefix \"WSe2\" are LT-STM images of crystal batch SL445, while the 89 images with prefix \"WSe2_1\" are RT-STM images of various crystal batches from the hone-barmak group STM.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Two forms of bounding box (bbox) annotations for the pre-processed STM images in the \"STM_images\" folder are provided in two formats: a .CSV with columns label, x, y, width, height, filename, resX, resY, and as .JSON objects which include metadata.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\"WSe2-Defect-Training-Images_2023-05-01.npy\" is the augmented training dataset of size [2,280 x 256 x 256]. It consits of 2,280 images with 256x256 resolution randomly cropped from the labeled 50 nm x 50 nm, 512 x 512 resolution STM images. \"WSe2-Defect-Training-Labels_2023-05-01.npy\" is the assocated atomic-scale defect segmentation mask dataset of size [2,280 x 256 x 256]. Each pixel is classified as 0 for noise or the atomic lattice, 1 for trough-like defects with dark contrast, and 2 for peak-like defects with bright contrast. Training masks were generated from the pre-processed images in \"STM_images\", .JSON labels, and mean defect diminsions. These augmented images and masks are the training data used for model training and evaluation.</div>"}, "title": "Scanning Tunneling Microscope Images of Atomic Scale Defects in Tungsten Diselenide", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/10443995", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/10443995?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10443995", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10443995", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.10443995", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443994", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/10443994", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10443994", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.10443994", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:10443995/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:10443995/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/10443995/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995/requests"}, "updated": "2024-01-01T21:19:49.959600+00:00", "recid": "10443995", "revision": 4, "files": [{"id": "452b2f17-5228-463d-a90a-ad442a105772", "key": "STM_data.zip", "size": 9267400573, "checksum": "md5:77c57897922eb7a661d17dbb2dd0fe8b", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995/files/STM_data.zip/content"}}, {"id": "b99374ae-b2ff-4a51-85c2-1c506def3975", "key": "WSe2-Defect-Training-Labels_2023-05-01.npy", "size": 1195376768, "checksum": "md5:54bb08aca3e8e3eda81d4fd4a76051c1", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995/files/WSe2-Defect-Training-Labels_2023-05-01.npy/content"}}, {"id": "1bb7c62d-0dfd-4b56-876b-7e9fdb10aa88", "key": "WSe2-Defect-Training-Images_2023-05-01.npy", "size": 597688448, "checksum": "md5:bf0632aeb7c559ab5125a879f6923a5b", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995/files/WSe2-Defect-Training-Images_2023-05-01.npy/content"}}, {"id": "f7d32f50-da26-4798-a785-133f9f241ab6", "key": "STM_images.zip", "size": 19948337, "checksum": "md5:ee9903badbbb9e1eeccbca58c9219b67", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995/files/STM_images.zip/content"}}, {"id": "32889f20-9416-40c8-9a2b-7ccceabda0d9", "key": "annotations.json", "size": 542896, "checksum": "md5:433d6c9e63fe6a998372c5555a39b02f", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995/files/annotations.json/content"}}, {"id": "1c681600-10fa-46c6-a15d-6291230da33f", "key": "annotations.csv", "size": 251948, "checksum": "md5:eac16a3986de684f4e86dd057b4c2667", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10443995/files/annotations.csv/content"}}], "swh": null, "owners": [{"id": "255838"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 1077, "unique_downloads": 835, "views": 555, "unique_views": 499, "version_downloads": 1077, "version_unique_downloads": 835, "version_unique_views": 499, "version_views": 555}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}, {"created": "2026-09-17T09:35:25.084728+00:00", "modified": "2026-09-17T09:35:25.822397+00:00", "id": 22806339, "conceptrecid": "22806338", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22806339", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.22806338", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22806339", "metadata": {"title": "Moir\u00e9 STM topography benchmark case for StructureLockInSTM", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22806339", "publication_date": "2026-09-17", "description": "<p>A versioned public regression benchmark case containing the original Nanonis SXM scan, a calibrated non-executable input adapter, a frozen StructureLockInSTM result bundle, the controlled protocol, checksums, and a two-reviewer record. Golden output is an expert-reviewed frozen regression reference, not scientific ground truth. README figures crop 30 px (nominal 17.578125 nm) per edge for display only; the scientific ROI is the full 256 &times; 256 scan.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Tian, Ziyi", "affiliation": null, "orcid": "0009-0002-0008-3953"}], "keywords": ["scanning tunneling microscopy", "moire"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.1038/s41467-026-77046-6", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "publication-article", "scheme": "doi"}], "version": "1.0.0", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "22806338"}}]}}, "title": "Moir\u00e9 STM topography benchmark case for StructureLockInSTM", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/228063